  "id": "sui-juris",
  "term": "sui juris",
  "definition": "In this historical legal-psychiatric usage, sui juris means being legally competent to act for oneself rather than being under a guardian because of minority or formal legal disability. In the passage, it refers to a person who is legally their own master in law even if alleged to be insane.",
